                "loc": "NUM.28.16+NUM.28.17+NUM.28.18+NUM.28.19+NUM.28.20+NUM.28.21+NUM.28.22+NUM.28.23+NUM.28.24+NUM.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 28.16-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I nino dwe apar wie aŋwen me dwe me agege, ibino cako wunu kwero ecuban me Kato. Jo luŋ bino camo kwon ame tobi mom iye pi nino abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino me agege ame ocako kwero iye ecubannono, alamdog adwoŋ bino yalo Obaŋa twon, acalo mot me kwanyo ballere en ikome kede me a lwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino acel acel ame tye i nino abiro me kwero ecubannono, en bino yalo Rwot itino twoni abiro, itino rommi abiro, ame balloro mom i komgi, kun owaŋogi awaŋa alutu, dok daŋ bino yalo Rwot i nyok dyel acalo mot me kwanyo bal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi mot me atin twon acel acel kede nyok romo acel acel ame oyalo kede Rwot myero daŋ mottere me moko kwoŋ kede moo bed tye, moko kwoŋ ame romo gwata moko apar pi atin twon acel acel kede nyok romo acel acel, kede moo jeituni ame romo cupa apar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
